WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:04.940
Torqyean Calendar Year 76, August 10th,

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.110
the anti-Imperial Alliance council falls into
disorder over the matter of Cielo's sovereignty.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.360
REPUBLIC OF FIORE

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.650
The council's general opinion

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.910
was that Cielo should be placed
under neighboring Espada's rule

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.280
and Cuore's mercenaries should be

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.460
stationed there to defend against the Imperial Army.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:28.040
38 of the 55 countries in the anti-Imperial Alliance
voted in favor of the rule.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.300
However,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.090
in order to defeat the Imperial beast,

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.630
we need a beast of our own.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.510
With great fortune, we have

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.390
gained a beast that shares our values as an ally.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.930
No matter how anti-Torqyean
one might be,

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.690
no one would oppose that concept.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.900
Due to Lucio's speech,

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:52.070
for the first time since Torqye's founding
76 years ago,

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:55.110
it acquired its first state, Cielo.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.410
And...

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:02.080
Furthermore, I will announce the new state of Cielo's
government officials.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.540
Kayut,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.500
as the eyalet for the governor-general
of the newly established Cielo,

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.090
Tughril Mahmut Pasha!

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.760
It's only natural.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.470
He's the greatest contributor
to Cielo's military campaign.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.470
Next in line, the commissioner.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.930
Kurt Kurt Pasha and Shanslar Nurcan Pasha.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:25.100
Also, Ahmet Bey, as the binbashu,

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.900
will work directly with the governor-general.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.570
The contract with El Toro will be extended,

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:33.610
and he will be assigned there.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.400
However, this is due to the losses and lack of soldiers

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:40.370
and is a special case.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.250
I know of Mahmut Pasha's strong trust in them.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:45.830
I ask for your understanding.

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.290
This too is a special case,

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:52.800
but I appoint Mimar Zeki Pasha as
the Construction Director,

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.260
who will lead the re-building of Cielo's city,
and assist the governor-general.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:00.970
This closes matters regarding
military personnel affairs.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:04.100
It's enough to defend, but not to attack.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.060
Perhaps, it means to let it

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.690
be a stalemate at the
South Rumeriana war front?

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:13.520
INSTIGATION

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:27.040
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.330
Since Halil was killed in battle,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.460
Zehir Zaganos Pasha holds Divan's power.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.460
It was of his descent, but it was as expected.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.670
Oh?

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.260
Now that it is a part of Torqye,

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.640
Torqyean law will apply to the state of Cielo.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:09.270
Therefore, Cielo can no longer rely on the charity

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.730
of other nations as its source
of financial stability.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.440
It can also be said that
the Torqyean city

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.690
Imalett shall be rebuilt.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.610
Markets, bathhouses, businesses

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.910
and hospitals, distribution centers,
and other social welfare institutions.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.910
The profits made by the businesses
will support the social welfare

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.620
institutions and become Cielo's
source of income.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.170
Mahmut Pasha, how will you secure
the land for Imalett's

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.750
massive reconstruction?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.380
-Regarding that--
-I will answer that.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.180
Tear down 10 of the poorhouses.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.300
When rebuilding during a time of war,

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.560
you should be as time efficient
and economical as possible.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.230
-No, that's--
-No, Zeki Pasha.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:56.020
You should keep Cielo's original system.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.190
Destroying the poorhouses is

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.860
the same as destroying Cielo people's pride.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.280
There are things you
must not take without reason.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.950
Life, resources, and pride.
Those three things.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.700
Citizens who have these taken away
will never forgive the statesman for it.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.040
It's true our time and resources are limited.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.670
It is better than buying the citizens' hatred.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.210
However, if we leave Cielo's current structure--

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.460
Cielo is not just a territory of Torqye.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.470
It is the first territory our country has gained.

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:28.050
In other words,
when the time of Torqye's empire comes,

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.890
it will be known as the Torqye Empire's first province.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.440
An empire!? With just one new city? That's a bit

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.320
arrogant, isn't it!?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:44.740
Don't get so agitated. It's just an example.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.070
But surely you know?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.280
3,400 years ago,

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.660
when Phoinike was just one city,

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.370
the city of Furulio became a part of it.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.540
That was the ancient Phoinike Empire's

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.340
first step toward expanding all across the continent.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.710
The governance of Cielo will

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.220
decide the future governance of Torqye.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.970
I concur.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.890
Just as Zaganos says

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.900
unlike the Phoinikian's successful allying
with the local people,

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:23.020
Balt-Rhein made the wrong first step,

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.360
and as it expanded it only spread discontent
within its territories.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.530
If we neglect the citizens, there is no future.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.990
Cielo especially,

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.580
will greatly influence Torqye's future.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.460
It appears we've come to our conclusion.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.590
How will you take responsibility, Minister Louis?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.260
Centro, Cielo and Espada.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.720
Together, a total of 118,000

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.220
soldiers were lost.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.100
Do you all see that as a failure?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.190
During this battle, we took Scoglio

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:03.360
and the lower part of South Rumeriana.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:08.490
Even now, we have eight times the military
strength of Torqye.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:12.700
I don't understand why you are
fussing so much.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.200
Enough is enough, Minister Louis.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:19.460
Now is the time to make peace with Torqye.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.210
At this time, both countries have ceased battle.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.880
This opportunity will not come again.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.960
How will you make peace?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:31.550
We will bring back the empire our next attempt.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:36.760
The lands you gained have a better climate,
and if we focus on the

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.480
improvement of our domestic affairs,

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.480
we could enrich our country.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.060
That's enough.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.900
Yes, that would be good even for me.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.990
However, Torqye will definitely
not make peace with us

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.950
because Zaganos Pasha controls Divan.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.240
Zaganos!?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.370
Zehir Zaganos Pasha.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.620
He knows well the Empire's weakness.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:07.210
The Empire's Star of Despair.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.840
He won't stop fighting
until he has utterly destroyed the Empire.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.550
Well-reasoned personnel assignments, right?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.310
I want our Padrone to climb higher.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.560
Because Venedik would be more grateful?

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.100
Because the Republic's Parliament recognizes it.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.650
You'll be busy.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.030
Yeah, as Cielo's reconstruction looks
to be quite the task.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:34.530
No, not for that reason.
Torqye is going to invade the Empire's territory.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.450
This battle marked the

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.740
Empire's greatest defeat in history.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:44.920
With that many soldiers lost, there's no telling
how long before the citizens erupt in anger.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:48.420
Zaganos Pasha will not miss this
golden opportunity.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.300
So the war continues.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.720
What about Mahmut Pasha?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.390
As the first-rank Pasha, he's in a difficult spot.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.850
I've heard there isn't enough strength

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.230
to resist Zaganos Pasha in Divan.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.390
In that sense also, the citizens

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.900
expect much from our Padrone.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:12.320
In order to stop the war, we must advance
with our deeds on the battlefield.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:16.740
How ironic. Though our job is the same.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.250
You got results.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.920
It was a magnificent battle.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.210
And you achieved Halil Pasha's revenge.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.050
Revenge?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.670
That wasn't my intent.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.640
It's not revenge?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.850
No. When we lost Halil Pasha,

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.930
I thought of only one thing.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.600
To carry on with the Pasha's fight.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.440
Halil Pasha

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:53.070
is irreplaceable for Torqye.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:57.240
But I must do everything within my power...

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.870
Your hometown was destroyed, wasn't it?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.200
Do you not hate Balt-Rhein?

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.620
I hate it. They took precious lives,

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.580
resources, and pride.

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.420
However, citizens build the country.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:16.380
If so, it is not the country that I should hate,
but hate war itself.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.760
His family and loved ones
were all taken from him,

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.930
but he doesn't seek revenge.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.850
You and I

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.520
are different.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.060
You are not mistaken, but you are also not right.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.900
I am the same.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.860
There are many righteous paths for rulers to take.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.400
It's a matter of taking the course you believe in.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.160
Even if you struggle with contradictions.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.030
As in turning

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.410
Torqye into an empire?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.120
So it is not merely a parable.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.120
You intend to continue attacking the empire?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.090
Do you think I am wrong in pursuing this course?

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:57.010
I cannot say. In order to stop the war,

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.260
I think it cannot be avoided.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.050
Halil Pasha also fought

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.970
for that purpose.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.760
Now, this is the only road we can take.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.100
Nations are not only moved by citizens.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:10.440
If you do not eradicate those who wish war,

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.810
war will not stop.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.020
You gave me this.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.740
I visited many countries and saw many things.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.400
The world is complicated.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.490
It cannot only be changed by the most ideal methods.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.950
To prevent malignant empires like the Balt-Rhein,

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.950
it is necessary that
Torqye becomes a benevolent empire.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.710
I understand.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.460
No. You don't, Mahmut Pasha.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:36.920
A long,

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.170
long battle lies ahead.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.300
You have the power to stop the war.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.180
Please stop this war.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.640
No.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.020
If it could be stopped,

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.650
it would not be by me, but by you.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.780
And the only person who can fill the hole
that Halil Pasha has left

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.240
is you.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:05.070
Continue on your path, Mahmut Pasha.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.010
Is the Emperor's national tour

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.840
your idea?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.760
It's necessary in order to gain
sentiment among the public.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.180
A moment of comfort,
like a drip of water on parched soil.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.980
No, this time, it's different.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.390
We'll repair old roads and bridges,

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.900
and construct lodgings at no cost for the citizens.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.730
It's being carried out as a public works project.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.110
New jobs are created where the Emperor visits,

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.780
and trust in the Empire is being restored.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.160
And the funding?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.950
I have the Louis family finances.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.080
So that's how you duped the council members?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.540
That's a disreputable thing to say.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.210
Our family has assisted in
the Emperor's financial affairs

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.090
numerous times.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.510
And if it's not enough?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.180
There are the taxes

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.470
from our newly acquired territory, South Rumeriana.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.180
You're a villain.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.560
It's part of the Empire.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.640
There's nothing villainous about it.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.770
Well, if we fight any further with Torqye, it will

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.110
come down to that.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:23.070
Zaganos Pasha will not sit idly.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.030
Zaganos? That noble's servant?

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.490
He wasn't just a servant.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.460
By the way, do you know Mahmut Pasha,
the one that defeated

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.830
General Pino?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.920
I've never seen him.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.750
I have.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.960
His commanding ability and martial arts

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.130
are nothing spectacular.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.880
I have also met him once.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.050
He isn't easily understood.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.640
He seems smart, but he was young.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:56.310
But he caught everyone with one throw of the rope.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.560
Why are you giving him so much attention?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.820
He's nothing of importance.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.280
Well, I hope so.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.650
You should worry about Zaganos instead.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.280
He's vindictive and vengeful.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.030
Well, I will take caution.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.210
If we don't fight,
this country is doomed to fall into ruin.

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.870
A few days later,

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.210
the Divan gave Zaganos
permission to invade the Empire.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:27.090
It's just as Suleyman Bey said.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.760
That Divan didn't think the campaign would easily

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.850
be approved.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.310
It's because Pashas' focus
is on 10 to 100 years in the future,

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.940
and act accordingly.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.270
The Divan company thinks and acts the same way.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.190
If you hope for the prosperity of Torqye,

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.740
the destruction of the Empire is crucial.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.740
And if we act now, it's possible.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.240
In any case, we can only follow.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.280
Even if we can't stop the war,

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.660
we may be able to do something.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.960
I truly share a common destiny,

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:02.630
with you.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.590
I have taken what you said, and thought about it.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.920
Hopefully it doesn't displease you.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.470
This is Torqye and Cielo's

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.510
cultures combined...

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.390
Well done!

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.850
The citizens of Cielo will be open to this.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:22.730
If my talents are of use in building the new Torqye,

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.770
then please let me help.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.280
Mahmut Pasha.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.990
Please.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.740
With that, take care, you two.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.580
You too, Pasha. Look after him, Abiriga.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:37.830
Leave it to me.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.870
Cielo's frontline.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.330
I know it won't change anything,

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.630
but do as you please, Mahmut!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.550
If it's you, you can build a peaceful city.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.380
Yes.

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:51.220
-A farewell gift, take it.
-Okay.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.300
See you, brothers.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:56.970
-Was that liquor?
-The Pasha doesn't drink.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.850
That's special liquor and liquor has uses
other than drinking.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.270
Unlike you, the Pasha won't use it to
charm the ladies either.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.520
What do you think I am!?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.740
This is how new beginnings look, not bad.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.700
Erbach, you're in a good mood.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.330
The militarily-experienced Torqye is making a city!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.250
Isn't it exciting to see how it turns out?

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.460
It's all thanks to you, Mahmut Pasha

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.800
that we could begin this
large-scale reconstruction project.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.550
You supported the preservation
of Cielo's original system.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.760
And with large charitable donations

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.890
and Torqye's technology, we've done it.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.060
I'm so happy to hear that.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.980
Director Carbajal

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:47.190
said we all carry the key to heaven.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.820
He gave his life

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.280
and gave us innumerable keys.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.780
Just like the ending in his play,

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.490
this will become a paradise for refugees.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.330
Casandra,

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.870
would you allow Imalett

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.460
to use Director Carbajal's name?

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.880
I would like to name it Carbajal Imalett.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:13.090
We'd be honored, Mahmut Pasha.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.180
The Empire's army won't move for some time.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.010
That's good news.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.350
We can use more people for the reconstruction.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.810
Halil Pasha is looking over you, Zeki.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.400
Indeed, perhaps he is.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.530
Padrone, a visitor.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.200
They say an old kulak at Campana.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.420
Why for me?

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.630
Pasha, your hometown was destroyed
by the Empire, right?

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.500
-Yes.
-Me too!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.510
I want to strike the Empire.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.220
If you use this you can, right?

00:17:56.470 --> 00:18:00.390
I want to kill all those people that turned
Campana into a sea of fire.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.640
-It's true. With this--
-Please make it.

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.100
Let me help!

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.690
Vasco, war is a burden.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.690
If we make this and use it on the battlefield

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.570
the Empire will try and make a similar weapon.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.570
It will only come to be used against us.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.450
-This is too--
-This technology has not leaked.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.740
It's just here.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.200
If this doesn't get out--

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:29.330
Those who see it will understand it and copy it.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:32.460
That cannot be prevented.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.550
Someday, you will see.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.880
What are you doing?

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.180
When that day comes, you'll understand.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.680
I can't understand, I don't want to.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.640
That day will come.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.020
Halil Pasha said the same thing.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.310
And burned my drawing.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.360
I became Pasha

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.530
because of Halil Pasha.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.860
Thanks to that,

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.070
I have an influence on my home country, Torqye.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.370
The current state of things is far from ideal,

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:05.950
but even that being said,

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.120
I believe we are pursuing the choice
for the best results.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.130
If I use your technology,

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.750
more people will lose their lives.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.090
Civilians will become victims.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.470
Even if the war ends,

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.050
I don't know how many people
like you will remain after the war.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.510
Will you

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.350
keep this technology secret until the war ends?

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.600
I...

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.560
I will defeat the Empire.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:35.820
Vasco.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.280
If I don't,

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.780
then what reason did my master and friends die for?

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.990
What reason?

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.240
Everyone died.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.210
If you don't eat and get defeated, it's a total loss!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.670
I'm concerned about the other side of the river.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.970
There doesn't appear to be any movement.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.800
It's that territory's governor-general.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.600
The Pasha who defeated General Pino?

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.680
-He's the key.
-Key?

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.640
That key will control

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.520
Rumeriana's destiny.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.400
Cielo's key.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:19.320
-They can't lose to us.
-Indeed.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.820
The continent has lionized ancient Phoinike

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.280
because it is

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.290
the first country in history to have thrived.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.040
If Balt-Rhein achieves prosperity greater than that,

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.710
it will become the new precedent for the continent.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.210
Therefore, we must continue to fight and win.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.710
Do you understand, Nicolo?

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.340
Yes!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.130
In general...

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.010
You'll understand one day.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.350
It's not that I like war,

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.810
I am only a patriot who

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.020
wishes for the longevity of the Empire.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.270
Yes!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.520
TORQYE PASHALU BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE BORDER
HISAR

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.270
Well done, Ibrahim Vali.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.570
SUNUL CAP

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:01.570
To complete it in only four months...

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.240
Even if the Empire were to attack,

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.160
it would hold them back.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.410
HISAR VALI
SHAPKA IBRAHIM VALI

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.240
Please be safe, Zaganos Pasha.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.120
Sunul Cap, open!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.960
Marche Vajra!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.890
September 5th, Torqyean Calendar Year 76

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.470
On this day, approximately 40,000 of the
Torqyean Army lead by Zaganos

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.980
began the invasion of the Balt-Rhein Empire.

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:53.390
On that day, 13 years ago,

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:56.180
if I hadn't picked up the stone
that fell from heaven...

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:57.560
If I hadn't met

00:22:57.770 --> 00:22:59.730
Halil Pasha at the destroyed village...

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.060
I wouldn't have lived.

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:04.940
Therefore, I believe the meaning of my life

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:07.400
is to bring Halil Pasha's vision

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.450
into fruition.

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:12.740
In order to stop the war,

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:15.040
I will choose the righteous path.

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:17.330
That is also their purpose

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:19.290
and why they fight.

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:38.640
Iskandar,

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:40.020
let's go.

00:23:41.730 --> 00:23:44.310
November 14th, Torqyean Calendar Year 76
Carbajal Imalett completed.

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:46.980
Thereafter, Cielo never became a battlefield.
